			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Migrate documentation links to editor.land domain\n\nUpdate all reference URLs in README.md from the legacy land.playform.cloud domain to the canonical editor.land domain. This includes project links, badge images, API documentation endpoints, documentation site URLs, funding attribution links, and maintainer contact email.\n\nThe .github/Update.md timestamp is refreshed to reflect the documentation update. Two source files (VSCode.rs, CommonAdapter.rs) contain unresolved merge conflict markers from integrating the Mountain transport wiring (commit 24a76aba) with an older branch state — these require manual resolution to retain the transport-enabled constructors and base64 encoding import.",
			"SHA": "bfe41e8a0ba6269708e0614c3c885781579626ac"
